{"ts": "2026-10-29T07:22:05.832611Z", "run_id": "r-20261029T0711Z-dbf6", "unit": "openspec:add-api-pep", "seq": 53, "type": "task.done", "task": "1.1", "base": "93e3ac9edf4483c28578044fdcfe5b0a16425748", "parents": [], "notes": "The frozen red test C-d738ea05 defines an unwired hmac route without an action and expects ROUTE_AUTH_UNWIRED, so the auth-wired check runs before the action checks (the task text lists action first). The test also defines a bearer route after server.inject has started the Fastify instance; registration after start is not possible in Fastify 5, so defineRoute records the definition without re-registering in that edge case. Route schemas are shallow-copied before server.route so Fastify's schema visited symbol does not leak into listDefinedRoutes.", "suppressions": []}
